WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.580
- Is there anything you've
had a hard time letting go of?

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:07.997
(Marie speaking in foreign language)

00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:18.230
- So there's actually a t-shirt
that I purchased in 2005,

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:21.000
a long time ago that I
just can't get rid of.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.261
- [Audience] Aw!

00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:24.240
- It's so clean!

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.100
From 2005, no stains, what?

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.380
(Marie speaking in foreign language)

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.032
Someone owns a Tide pen.

00:00:31.032 --> 00:00:34.532
(Seth and Kelly laughing)

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.930
- It's a little embarrassing
and I can't explain why,

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.930
but it just sparks so
much joy inside of me

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.267
and this is the first time
that I'm showing it on TV.

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:46.100
(man laughs)

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.190
- You know, it would spark joy
in me if I could fit in it.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:51.747
That would spark joy.
(all laughs)

